# R136: Muse R136's probe r136_ws1_cell_minimal (Muse-to-Sarvam/r136_ws1_cell_minimal.sm, unchanged below). v306 and v307 compile the escapes; v308 refuses them.
mukhya() {
    kosh k[1]
    kosh_kship(k, 7)
    vitti obstacle = nirmmita(16)
    mala box[1]
